	"quest.18980608663312D1.quest_subtitle": "A spell to be known by"
	"quest.18980608663312D1.title": "Thread, Seal and Chain: Signature"
	"quest.18D4D1E3B139CE92.quest_desc": [
		"Win in the arena carrying no relic at all: not in your hands, not in your slots, not in your bag. Skill, grimoire and nothing else."
