		"A Grimoire Daemon guards a book too old to read. Defeat one."
	]
	"quest.5F39A23FC8DB81E9.quest_subtitle": "A grimoire that fights back"
	"quest.5F39A23FC8DB81E9.title": "Daemon of the Grimoire"
